      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc926817964bd6fb84beb9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因出身自经营医院的家庭，真弓快车自小\n便常常接触生命议题。或许也因此导致了她\n老是担忧总有一天会被人们遗忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40dab3bacdd030055026256b8990ce89e860dedfd40c358c5a97bf5632ef1eba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae59d0d4e26d63ce2f5780c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该怎么做才能留在人们的记忆中呢？\n她得出了一个结论，就是让URA为自己制作\n官方吉祥物并推广到全世界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc667c17f15b214a92d663a3f0fc64dafbb9f052ea73a8a213ed2d1b05f2e9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:658bfa7b565a9ed25f79c039",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而同世代对手的实力十分高强。\n大和赤骥在比赛上与学业上都是优等生。\n同时还有一心追求帅气的伏特加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b648f533a47d25b410c7c509f709a977f30d9c3836b2900bb2a59b216a8b7411",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38cd109e6f983c3318d36230",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而想要抓住人心、留下记忆的她\n决定挑战三后冠路线……目标是\n称霸“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”与“秋华赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "490ccd622c39d011b24a2a5dd627606519402771d7443083084097544fa10950",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eaba8ea7e55fd1d849864ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了当上超级无敌厉害吉祥物\n而努力奋战的时光就此展开……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82151a8d8e3da207a1f55f212e7bac314a8c45972d5e73ac1e4fca6e4be95344",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087400.json",
      "json_path": [
